#basePath P2_Lampricide
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Start
@trigger    OnLocationChanged
// "NONE" ensures no other threads are in-progress
// global:currentPhase == 2 ensures player is in phase 2
@when       global:currentThread == "NONE", global:currentPhase == 2, location == "FieldStationLampricide"
@cutscene
// Lock all location on map
$call SetInThreadLocks()
$call DisableMapButton()

// Mark start of thread
$set global:currentThread = "P2_Lampricide"

{@}   
       Paul had mentioned something called lampricide, and a quick call to Renée confirmed that the Field Station used to apply lampricide. 
       So here you are, on the shore of one of the lake's many tributaries, being attacked by a horde of mosquitoes. 

{@Claire}
       Isn't this WONDERFUL?!

{@}
       At your side, the Field Station's engineer, Claire, looks out at the water like a mother would her child. 

{@You}
       I'm not sure if wonderful is the word I'd use...

{@Claire}
       Ah, but the mosquitoes are part of the experience! Here, put on more bug repellant! 
       We must be valiant towards diseases spread by insects like mosquitoes and ticks!

{@}
       She covers you in a thick layer of repellant and ensures your legs are properly covered by your pants and socks. 

{@Claire}
       Excellent! We are PREPARED! Now, what has brought you to my domain, young scientist?!

{@You}
       Um, I'm here to ask you about something called lampricide?

{@Claire}
       Yes! LAMPRICIDE! We used to apply it to the tributaries around the lake!
       
{@You}
       So, like, what </i>is</i> lampricide?

{@Claire}
       Lampricide is a pesticide that kills sea lamprey larvae! Hmm. Firstly, you must understand the life cycle of sea lamprey! 
       Sea lamprey eggs are laid in tributaries, which are small rivers that feed into the lake!
       Once the eggs hatch, sea lamprey spend the first four to five years as larvae buried in the riverbed, eating organic material that floats past them!
       After maturing, the sea lamprey then swim towards the lake and spend 12-16 months there before returning to the tributary to spawn and die!

{@You}
       So this lampricide is only effective when the sea lamprey are in this larvae stage?

{@Claire}
       PRECISELY, young scientist! And it is very effective at lowering the population of sea lamprey! //evidence chip

{@You}
       You do know that you can't be more than, like, five years older than me?

{@Claire}
       We are ALL young at heart! I, too, am a young scientist!

{@You}
       Hmm. Well, if lampricide is so effective, why hasn't it been used recently?

{@}
       Claire's demeanor becomes more serious. 

{@Claire}
       After the pandemic, our lampricide program ended, and no new funding for lampricide has been given. 
       It's important to remember that not everyone wants to add chemicals to the water, and people have their worries about lampricide. 
       Though lampricide is safe, it's also important to respect the wishes of people like indigenous populations who would rather use other methods. 
       We are all working together to create a balanced ecosystem, so we have to decide on the next steps together and consult with the community. //evidence chip

{@You}
       Hm. I can go to the town hall later today and ask whether the town will give money for lampricide. 
       That way everyone will have a say in the next steps.  

{@}
       Claire smiles. 

{@Claire}
       Yes! That is an excellent idea, young scientist!

{@You}
       Thanks, young scientist. 

// TODO: Rest of Field Station section here

// TODO: Give evidence chip
// $call GiveEvidenceChip([Evidence])

$call UnlockLocation(TownHall)
$call EnableMapButton()


:: AtTownHall
@trigger    OnLocationChanged
// global:currentThread ensures the correct thread
// global:currentPhase == 2 ensures player is in phase 2
@when       global:currentThread == "P2_Lampricide", global:currentPhase == 2, location == "TownHall"
// Lock all location on map
$call SetInThreadLocks()
$call DisableMapButton()

{@}   
       [This is the Town Hall section.]

// TODO: Rest of Town Hall section here

// TODO: Give action card
// $call GiveActionCard([Action])


// TEMPORARY: skip to end
$goto .End


:: End
@tracked
// Unlock next locations
$call UnlockLocation(ArmyCorps)    // P2_Outreach

// Mark end of thread
$set global:currentThread = "NONE"

// Go to Phase 2 Continue Hub
$goto P2_Hub.Continue